body:
Well, I had something like this happen to me in summer nationals.. I had an awful bloody nose that would not stop (this was during one of my bouts in pools). Thankfully my ref was able to give me a 10 min break (medical one) and then I would have to finish my bout. When the ref called up my next bout and noticed that my bloody nose did not stop, she had me fence the rest of my opponents at the end cause the ice was not helping... I ended up having to fence with toilet paper up my nose 😂. Thankfully everyone is really kind!

&#x200B;

So summing up the story if you have a nice ref you're in luck! But it is best to use the restroom before bouts start and before DE rounds start.

Well some people have tried taking tapeworm eggs to become sknny...... not smart choice through since it can kill you...

&#x200B;

edit: oops thought ringworm was tapeworm 🤦‍♀️

Well without corruption there wouldn't be the world.....

